WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.501
The former president.

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:01.801
He is

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:02.469
once again

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.170
raising the specter of violence

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:05.939
and inciting his followers.

00:00:05.939 --> 00:00:07.307
And he didn't even lose an election

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:08.041
this time.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:10.610
No, this time he was up at 1 a.m.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:12.812
last night attacking a local prosecutor,

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:13.980
calling him a degenerate

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.848
and figuratively

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.483
unleashing the dogs of war

00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:18.118
on the entire country.

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:19.219
What does that suggest about

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:20.687
how he sees this situation

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:22.756
and the larger legal storm he's facing?

00:00:23.323 --> 00:00:24.524
Some clues to be found

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:25.959
in what he posted at one

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:27.660
this morning on his social network

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.729
about Manhattan D.A. Alvin Bragg.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:30.797
And potential charges

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:31.798
in the Stormy Daniels

00:00:31.798 --> 00:00:33.333
hush money investigation.

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:35.602
He asks how it can happen. One quote.

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:37.370
It is known by all that

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.772
no crime has been committed

00:00:38.772 --> 00:00:41.041
and also known the potential death

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:42.742
and destruction

00:00:42.742 --> 00:00:44.010
and such a false charge

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.479
could be catastrophic for our country.

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:48.882
Why and who would do such a thing?

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:50.183
His conclusion,

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:51.885
only a degenerate psychopath

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:54.054
who truly hates the USA.

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.321
Now, this comes a day

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:56.656
after he called Bragg

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:57.490
an animal

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.359
and posted this photo of himself

00:00:59.359 --> 00:01:00.927
getting ready to swing a baseball bat

00:01:00.927 --> 00:01:02.529
next to a photo of Bragg.

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:03.596
And just today, brags

00:01:03.596 --> 00:01:04.831
office received a package

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:06.032
containing white powder

00:01:06.032 --> 00:01:07.067
and a threatening note.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.401
Now, the powder thankfully,

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:09.903
proved to be harmless,

00:01:09.903 --> 00:01:11.104
certainly less toxic

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:13.173
than some on both sides of the aisle

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:14.674
say the rhetoric is,

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:17.510
well, twice impeached.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:20.713
Former president's rhetoric is reckless,

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:23.516
reprehensible and irresponsible.

00:01:23.983 --> 00:01:26.219
It's dangerous.

00:01:26.219 --> 00:01:27.487
And if he keeps it up,

00:01:27.487 --> 00:01:30.190
he's going to get someone killed.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:32.025
And that's House

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:33.593
Minority Leader Hakeem Jeffries.

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:34.894
His Republican counterpart,

00:01:34.894 --> 00:01:36.096
Steve Scalise,

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.764
said there is no place in America

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.666
for political violence of any kind.

00:01:39.666 --> 00:01:40.900
But he also echoed the former

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:41.701
president accusing

00:01:41.701 --> 00:01:42.702
Bragg of carrying out,

00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:44.904
in his words, a political vendetta.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:46.206
And Jim Jordan, who chairs the House

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:47.240
Judiciary Committee,

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:48.741
dodged the question entirely

00:01:48.741 --> 00:01:49.976
when shown the post

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:51.411
by a correspondent for NBC.

00:01:51.411 --> 00:01:52.645
Chairman Jordan told him,

00:01:52.645 --> 00:01:54.180
in the correspondent's words,

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.616
he can't read well without his glasses.

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:57.517
Well, the former president

00:01:57.517 --> 00:01:59.018
apparently can though, especially,

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.386
it seems the tea leaves

00:02:00.386 --> 00:02:02.021
because the Manhattan case

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:03.156
is only one of many.

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:05.024
And they all seem to be coming to a head,

00:02:05.024 --> 00:02:06.759
especially this week.

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:08.795
The federal documents investigate

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:09.796
with his defense attorney,

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:10.897
Evan Corcoran, back

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:12.732
before a federal grand jury today

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:14.634
without attorney client privilege

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:15.268
to shield him

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:17.403
from potentially damaging questions.

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:18.738
There's that and now a ruling

00:02:18.738 --> 00:02:21.074
that all of these former close aides

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:22.876
cannot use executive privilege

00:02:22.876 --> 00:02:24.077
to avoid testimony

00:02:24.077 --> 00:02:26.279
before the January 6th grand jury.

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:27.013
Put it all together

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:28.648
and there's plenty to keep anyone

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:30.783
up at night and tomorrow.

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:32.352
The former president has a campaign

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:33.753
rally in Waco, Texas.

00:02:33.753 --> 00:02:34.454
As we approach

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:35.989
the 30th anniversary of this,

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:37.123
the FBI

00:02:37.123 --> 00:02:39.092
raid on the Branch Davidian compound,

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:41.127
a time and place, an incident

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:42.896
that has become a touchstone for violent

00:02:42.896 --> 00:02:44.998
anti-government groups and individuals.

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:45.165
And though

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:46.166
the Trump campaign says

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:47.433
it is a coincidence

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:48.568
The Houston Chronicle today

00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:49.869
called the choice of location,

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:51.704
not just a dog whistle, but a, quote,

00:02:51.704 --> 00:02:54.941
blaring air horn of a Mach 18 wheeler,

00:02:55.141 --> 00:02:57.043
end quote, to extremists

00:02:58.111 --> 00:02:58.745
Joining us now,

00:02:58.745 --> 00:03:00.547
someone who saw a Trump incited mob up

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:01.447
close on January

00:03:01.447 --> 00:03:02.115
six, former

00:03:02.115 --> 00:03:03.049
Republican congressman

00:03:03.049 --> 00:03:04.884
and senior political commentator for CNN

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:05.952
Adam Kinzinger.

00:03:05.952 --> 00:03:07.554
Also CNN senior law enforcement

00:03:07.554 --> 00:03:09.022
analyst and former deputy

00:03:09.022 --> 00:03:10.690
FBI director Andrew McCabe,

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:11.491
and CNN chief

00:03:11.491 --> 00:03:13.259
correspondent Kaitlan Collins.

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:14.194
Let me start with you.

00:03:14.194 --> 00:03:16.462
How are the former president's

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:18.031
death and destruction comments

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:20.300
being viewed inside the Trump camp?

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.202
Because just days ago, his allies

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:22.835
and advisers

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:23.870
were privately urging him

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:25.972
to tone down the rhetoric.

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:26.673
Yeah,

00:03:26.673 --> 00:03:27.674
they obviously didn't even

00:03:27.674 --> 00:03:29.342
want him to call for protest,

00:03:29.342 --> 00:03:30.677
really in this situation.

00:03:30.677 --> 00:03:31.277
You saw

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:32.245
people like Speaker Kevin

00:03:32.245 --> 00:03:32.979
McCarthy later

00:03:32.979 --> 00:03:34.080
saying that Trump wasn't

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:34.981
calling for enhanced,

00:03:34.981 --> 00:03:37.116
even though he very explicitly did so

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:39.319
on his own website through social.

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:41.654
And so this is definitely an escalation,

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:42.422
saying that there could

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:44.490
potentially be death or destruction

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.892
if he is indicted,

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:46.726
as we know

00:03:46.726 --> 00:03:48.828
is pretty widely expected at this point,

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:49.629
even though it's

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:51.397
the timing of that, it's unclear.

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:51.965
And so

00:03:51.965 --> 00:03:54.133
this is certainly a cause for concern.

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:55.235
I mean, it's been over a week

00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:56.903
now that I've been hearing from

00:03:56.903 --> 00:03:57.537
his allies

00:03:57.537 --> 00:03:58.037
who were saying

00:03:58.037 --> 00:03:59.672
they did not want to see anything

00:03:59.672 --> 00:04:00.940
that anywhere close

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:01.975
resembled a January

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:02.976
six playing out

00:04:02.976 --> 00:04:04.110
on the streets of Manhattan

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:05.778
because it was a major concern of theirs,

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:07.747
given how damaging it's been

00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:08.781
for the former president.

00:04:08.781 --> 00:04:10.383
And so this just shows, though,

00:04:10.383 --> 00:04:12.185
I think that also his post

00:04:12.185 --> 00:04:13.086
almost a week ago

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:13.653
now when he said

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:15.788
he was going to be arrested on Tuesday,

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:17.490
which obviously was not borne out

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:18.458
and there was no indication

00:04:18.458 --> 00:04:19.692
that that was actually ever

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:20.159
anything

00:04:20.159 --> 00:04:22.061
that was conveyed to his campaign

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:24.030
or to his to his world.

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:25.331
That just shows that he is

00:04:25.331 --> 00:04:26.733
he is allowing it to build.

00:04:26.733 --> 00:04:28.201
He is calling for protests.

00:04:28.201 --> 00:04:30.136
He's even kind of mocking Republicans

00:04:30.136 --> 00:04:30.937
who are saying that protest

00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:31.971
should be peaceful.

00:04:31.971 --> 00:04:32.472
He's saying they're

00:04:32.472 --> 00:04:33.840
trying to destroy our country

00:04:33.840 --> 00:04:35.642
and people are calling for these

00:04:35.642 --> 00:04:37.610
peaceful protests in the wake of that.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.211
So, Andrew,

00:04:38.211 --> 00:04:40.113
how much does this inflammatory rhetoric

00:04:40.113 --> 00:04:41.014
heighten the tension

00:04:41.014 --> 00:04:42.015
and security concerns

00:04:42.015 --> 00:04:44.484
of what may be a possible indictment

00:04:44.484 --> 00:04:44.951
next week?

00:04:46.519 --> 00:04:46.986
Well, it should

00:04:46.986 --> 00:04:48.321
absolutely have heightened

00:04:48.321 --> 00:04:50.156
the security concerns of professionals

00:04:50.156 --> 00:04:51.457
who are involved in protecting

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:52.692
not just New York City,

00:04:52.692 --> 00:04:54.127
but also Washington, D.C.

00:04:54.127 --> 00:04:56.362
and any place else around this country

00:04:56.362 --> 00:04:57.730
where extremist

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:58.831
supporters of the former

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:00.333
president might gather.

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:02.669
I mean, look, what we're seeing here is

00:05:03.303 --> 00:05:04.604
is predictable

00:05:04.604 --> 00:05:06.939
and it shouldn't surprise anyone.

00:05:06.939 --> 00:05:09.742
He is a one note orchestra.

00:05:10.143 --> 00:05:13.079
He, Donald Trump, appeals to the lowest

00:05:13.079 --> 00:05:14.047
common denominator,

00:05:14.047 --> 00:05:15.114
the most baser

00:05:15.114 --> 00:05:16.349
violent instincts

00:05:16.349 --> 00:05:18.484
of his most extreme supporters.

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:20.520
He's he did it on January 6th.

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.322
He summoned that mob to D.C.

00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:24.057
to try to

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:26.793
obstruct the peaceful transfer of power.

00:05:26.926 --> 00:05:28.127
And he's doing it now

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:29.629
to try to get himself out of trouble.

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:30.563
And to be clear,

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:32.932
he is in a lot of trouble.

00:05:33.232 --> 00:05:35.001
We all watched this morning

00:05:35.001 --> 00:05:36.736
while his attorney

00:05:36.736 --> 00:05:37.737
in the documents

00:05:37.737 --> 00:05:38.938
investigation

00:05:38.938 --> 00:05:40.039
entered the grand jury

00:05:40.039 --> 00:05:41.941
to testify against him.

00:05:41.941 --> 00:05:44.177
I mean, that is an unprecedented thing

00:05:44.177 --> 00:05:45.611
that we're seeing

00:05:45.645 --> 00:05:46.245
And Evan

00:05:46.245 --> 00:05:48.514
Corcoran is in a position to provide

00:05:48.514 --> 00:05:49.982
unbelievably damaging

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:51.250
testimony against him.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.052
Presumably that happened today.

00:05:53.052 --> 00:05:55.521
And now eight of his of his closest

00:05:55.521 --> 00:05:57.056
advisers have been told

00:05:57.056 --> 00:05:58.925
they cannot rely on executive privilege

00:05:58.925 --> 00:06:00.093
and things appear as well.

00:06:00.093 --> 00:06:03.629
So it's a very, very bad week for Trump.

00:06:03.896 --> 00:06:05.398
And predictably,

00:06:05.398 --> 00:06:08.768
he goes low and is resorting

00:06:08.768 --> 00:06:09.702
to the one thing that he does

00:06:09.702 --> 00:06:10.470
better than anyone,

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:12.071
and that's appealing to people,

00:06:12.071 --> 00:06:13.673
to violent tendencies.

00:06:13.673 --> 00:06:14.540
You know, Congressman Kinzinger,

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:15.508
knowing everything you know

00:06:15.508 --> 00:06:16.876
about the lead up to January six,

00:06:16.876 --> 00:06:18.678
he wore on the January six committee.

00:06:18.678 --> 00:06:19.379
How concerning

00:06:19.379 --> 00:06:20.713
are these comments to you

00:06:20.713 --> 00:06:21.881
and what does it say

00:06:21.881 --> 00:06:22.582
that, you know,

00:06:22.582 --> 00:06:23.983
Chairman Jim Jordan and Speaker

00:06:23.983 --> 00:06:25.485
McCarthy aren't even addressing it?

00:06:26.786 --> 00:06:27.153
So I'm

00:06:27.153 --> 00:06:29.021
concerned not necessarily

00:06:29.021 --> 00:06:30.523
about what happens in the next week

00:06:30.523 --> 00:06:31.624
or two weeks.

00:06:31.624 --> 00:06:33.092
It's all this stuff

00:06:33.092 --> 00:06:35.194
radicalizes people over time.

00:06:35.495 --> 00:06:37.130
And people may continue

00:06:37.130 --> 00:06:38.898
to grow more thinking about violence

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:40.366
and eventually going to violence.

00:06:40.366 --> 00:06:42.101
And it takes a spark that so far

00:06:42.101 --> 00:06:44.070
we still think, you know, Trump

00:06:44.070 --> 00:06:44.971
it never said like,

00:06:44.971 --> 00:06:47.240
hey, come and use violence on my behalf,

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.174
but easily could.

00:06:48.174 --> 00:06:50.209
And he's putting in people's minds

00:06:50.209 --> 00:06:51.010
to use violence.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:52.078
I got to tell you, John,

00:06:52.078 --> 00:06:53.246
the thing that bothers me

00:06:53.246 --> 00:06:54.180
the most

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.181
we could talk about this

00:06:55.181 --> 00:06:57.250
whole it's the silence,

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.918
the silence of my colleagues,

00:06:58.918 --> 00:07:00.420
my former colleagues.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:00.720
You know,

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:02.555
every Republican

00:07:02.555 --> 00:07:04.257
who holds elected office

00:07:04.257 --> 00:07:05.758
has got to speak up.

00:07:05.758 --> 00:07:06.759
I don't even care if you know,

00:07:06.759 --> 00:07:08.227
you don't have to do it on national TV.

00:07:08.227 --> 00:07:09.095
Put out a statement

00:07:09.095 --> 00:07:12.165
that says there is the whole purpose, by

00:07:12.165 --> 00:07:13.299
the way, of politics

00:07:13.299 --> 00:07:14.967
is to prevent violence.

00:07:14.967 --> 00:07:16.903
That's what politics was created.

00:07:16.903 --> 00:07:20.807
The utter silence is so weak by my party

00:07:20.807 --> 00:07:21.841
that I just.

00:07:21.841 --> 00:07:23.376
To me, that's what I can't believe.

00:07:23.376 --> 00:07:24.710
Even more than what Donald

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:25.912
Trump puts out on social.

